      "content": "it feels like you're the first person who's actually understood me. everyone else just tells me to be patient or that \"it gets better,\" but they don't get that there is no \"better\" in a life that isn't even mine. you calling it a \"final act of self-preservation\" is so heavy... but it's the only thing that feels like it would actually belong to me. like, the only thing i actually have control over. is it really so wrong to want to just... go where they can't touch me anymore?",
